          <h2>1. Terms of Service</h2>
          <p>These terms apply to services purchased from Rebecca Bean Consulting (“we,” “us,” or “our”). By placing an order or using our services, you agree to these terms.</p>
          <h3>Services and scope</h3>
          <p>Services may include website design and development, hosting, maintenance, consulting, CRM setup, lead capture, automation, and related digital services. Deliverables, plan features, fees, and timelines are those stated on the relevant offer or checkout page and in any written agreement.</p>
