          <p>Our website or third-party tools may use cookies, pixels, or similar technologies for essential functions, performance measurement, or marketing, depending on the tools enabled on the site. Browser settings may allow you to block some cookies, though parts of the site may not work as intended. If applicable law requires consent or an opt-out mechanism for specific technologies, we will provide it.</p>
          <div class="policy-note"><p><strong>Before publishing:</strong> Check your live website, HighLevel pages, analytics, advertising pixels, and embedded tools. Remove claims about tools you do not use and add any consent banner or opt-out links required for your setup.</p></div>
